        <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>RetirementItemExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>485</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>The item that records the expenses related to the retirement of fixed assets.
Available items:
- Expenses related to the disposal of fixed assets. It is used to record the retirement via 01.09 account.
- Retirement of tangible assets. It is used to record the retirement via 03.09 account.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>قلمی که هزینه‌های مرتبط با کنارگذاری دارایی‌های ثابت را ثبت می‌کند.
اقلام موجود:
- هزینه‌های مرتبط با واگذاری دارایی‌های ثابت. برای ثبت کنارگذاری از طریق حساب 01.09 استفاده می‌شود.
- کنارگذاری دارایی‌های مشهود. برای ثبت کنارگذاری از طریق حساب 03.09 استفاده می‌شود.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Статья, по которой отражаются расходы, связанные с выбытием основных средств.
Доступны следующие статьи:
- Расходы, связанные со списанием ОС - используется для отражения выбытия через счет 01.09
- Выбытие материальных ценностей - используется для отражения выбытия через счет 03.09</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Sabit kıymetlerin elden çıkarılmasıyla ilgili giderlerin yansıtıldığı kalem.
Aşağıdaki kalemler mevcuttur:
- Sabit kıymetlerin silinmesiyle ilgili giderler - 01.09 hesabı üzerinden elden çıkarmayı yansıtmak için kullanılır
- Maddi varlıkların çıkışı - 03.09 hesabı üzerinden elden çıkarmayı yansıtmak için kullanılır</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>The item that records the expenses related to the retirement of fixed assets.
Available items:
- Expenses related to the disposal of fixed assets. It is used to record the retirement via 01.09 account.
- Retirement of tangible assets. It is used to record the retirement via 03.09 account.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>The item that records the expenses related to the retirement of fixed assets.
Available items:
- Expenses related to the disposal of fixed assets. It is used to record the retirement via 01.09 account.
- Retirement of tangible assets. It is used to record the retirement via 03.09 account.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>The item that records the expenses related to the retirement of fixed assets.
Available items:
- Expenses related to the disposal of fixed assets. It is used to record the retirement via 01.09 account.
- Retirement of tangible assets. It is used to record the retirement via 03.09 account.</value>
          </title>
          <formatted>true</formatted>
          <type>Label</type>
          <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
            <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
          </extInfo>
        </extendedTooltip>
